50:     - If the marker is on the top or bottom edge, compact moving-color pixels in every column toward that side.
51:     - Preserve the teal marker at its edge cell.
52:     - On the marker's row or column, color cells swept by shifted moving pixels maroon unless the final compacted line occupies them.
53: 
